  "note": "Policy is ScallopOnlyPolicy: the actor's MLP only produces facts (unsafe_gap, leader_close) for Scallop's merge_planner.scl; Scallop's next_action output IS the action logits directly, no separate raw-logits pathway and no combination step (the critic/value_net is still a normal learned component). This is the PPO counterpart of dqn_neurosymbolic_scalloponly_seed0_20260820_070458, and the closest match in this repo to the Scallop paper's own PacMan-Maze architecture. Compare against ppo_seed0_20260818_135738 (pure PPO baseline), ppo_neurosymbolic_seed0_20260818_142432 (fixed log-additive combine), and dqn_neurosymbolic_scalloponly_seed0_20260820_070458 (same scallop-only structure, DQN instead of PPO)."
